# docs/openapi/v2.json is written by python3 -m backend.openapi_v2. A clone that registers the merge driver
# (CONTRIBUTING.md) merges two edits to it with scripts/json_merge.py; without it git merges the text.
docs/openapi/v2.json merge=tico-json
# The three generated baselines merge by scripts/baseline_merge.py, which applies both sides' changes to their base.
# Git's text merge conflicts on neighbouring lines; the drivers do not. CONTRIBUTING.md registers them per clone.
ruff-baseline-counts.json merge=tico-baseline-counts
ruff-baseline.toml merge=tico-baseline-toml
.basedpyright/baseline.json merge=tico-baseline-pyright
